# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# FUTBALL configuration
#
# Everything the dashboard shows today works WITHOUT any of these keys, using
# public-domain sources: StatsBomb open data, football-data.co.uk and
# openfootball. The keys below unlock the two things those sources cannot
# provide.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Ordinary data folder on the Samsung T7. Connect the drive before starting.
# Source code and development dependencies stay in your Developer folder.
FUTBALL_DATA_ROOT=/Volumes/T7/FUTBALL-data

# --- recommended: current results + Champions League 2026/27 ---
# football-data.co.uk and openfootball only regenerate after a round finishes,
# so without this the league table sits a matchday behind for a day or two, and
# the Champions League has no current season at all (openfootball's CL
# repository stops at 2025-26).
#
# Free tier: 10 requests/minute, no daily cap, 12 competitions — which include
# all three this dashboard shows (PL, PD, CL). Free forever, no card.
# Register: https://www.football-data.org/client/register
FOOTBALL_DATA_ORG_KEY=

# --- optional: goal + assist leaders, UEFA Europa League, in-play events ---
# Free tier: 100 requests/day. That is too tight to drive the results refresh,
# so it is deliberately NOT used for that — football-data.org above carries it.
# This key is reserved for the things football-data.org charges for.
# Register: https://www.api-football.com/
API_FOOTBALL_KEY=

# Frontend -> API base URL
NEXT_PUBLIC_API_BASE=http://127.0.0.1:8008
